  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> là số bóng đỏ có trong hộp. Khi đó, tổng số bóng có trong hộp là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Xác suất lấy được 2 quả bóng xanh là: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></semantics></math>.<br>Xác suất lấy được 2 quả bóng đỏ là: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></semantics></math>. Theo đề bài, ta có:\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tDo <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> là số tự nhiên nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, xác suất của biến cố <span>““</span>Cả 2 quả bóng lấy ra đều có cùng màu<span>””</span> là \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
